    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Manage your own supermarket!</h2>Expand your store, make it bigger and provide the best possible service. Create promotions and set competitive prices so that the goods sell quickly. Handle cash and card payments. Have fun and don't go broke. Achieve real success.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057580/extras/c67f799fe9c08e53a0cc744de26d51de.poster.avif?t=1753731719\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057580/extras/c67f799fe9c08e53a0cc744de26d51de.webm?t=1753731719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057580/extras/c67f799fe9c08e53a0cc744de26d51de.mp4?t=1753731719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Expand your product range</h2>Unlock new products, activities and services that will satisfy even the most demanding customers.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057580/extras/da5e24210210583db1538685d3eb4b8b.poster.avif?t=1753731719\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057580/extras/da5e24210210583db1538685d3eb4b8b.webm?t=1753731719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057580/extras/da5e24210210583db1538685d3eb4b8b.mp4?t=1753731719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customise your supermarket</h2>Prepare your store appropriately for your goods - choose from racks, cabinets, refrigerators or freezers.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057580/extras/0174f060e0c967731c00eefcdf97a534.poster.avif?t=1753731719\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057580/extras/0174f060e0c967731c00eefcdf97a534.webm?t=1753731719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057580/extras/0174f060e0c967731c00eefcdf97a534.mp4?t=1753731719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Shopkeeper Simulator is not just a game - it is a challenge that will test your management and strategy skills. Try it today and show how a real supermarket is run!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057580/extras/d4e39e8eaf9ce48631d601cccf6f2f5c.poster.avif?t=1753731719\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057580/extras/d4e39e8eaf9ce48631d601cccf6f2f5c.webm?t=1753731719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057580/extras/d4e39e8eaf9ce48631d601cccf6f2f5c.mp4?t=1753731719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Manage your own supermarket!</h2>Expand your store, make it bigger and provide the best possible service. Create promotions and set competitive prices so that the goods sell quickly. Handle cash and card payments. Have fun and don't go broke. Achieve real success.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057580/extras/c67f799fe9c08e53a0cc744de26d51de.poster.avif?t=1753731719\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057580/extras/c67f799fe9c08e53a0cc744de26d51de.webm?t=1753731719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057580/extras/c67f799fe9c08e53a0cc744de26d51de.mp4?t=1753731719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Expand your product range</h2>Unlock new products, activities and services that will satisfy even the most demanding customers.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057580/extras/da5e24210210583db1538685d3eb4b8b.poster.avif?t=1753731719\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057580/extras/da5e24210210583db1538685d3eb4b8b.webm?t=1753731719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057580/extras/da5e24210210583db1538685d3eb4b8b.mp4?t=1753731719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customise your supermarket</h2>Prepare your store appropriately for your goods - choose from racks, cabinets, refrigerators or freezers.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057580/extras/0174f060e0c967731c00eefcdf97a534.poster.avif?t=1753731719\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057580/extras/0174f060e0c967731c00eefcdf97a534.webm?t=1753731719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057580/extras/0174f060e0c967731c00eefcdf97a534.mp4?t=1753731719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Shopkeeper Simulator is not just a game - it is a challenge that will test your management and strategy skills. Try it today and show how a real supermarket is run!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057580/extras/d4e39e8eaf9ce48631d601cccf6f2f5c.poster.avif?t=1753731719\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057580/extras/d4e39e8eaf9ce48631d601cccf6f2f5c.webm?t=1753731719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1057580/extras/d4e39e8eaf9ce48631d601cccf6f2f5c.mp4?t=1753731719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
